# The E4 reference sample banks are written as uncompressed float64 .npz and
# exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit: the PT-MALA bank is ~110 MB and
# the SNIS weighted cross-check ~519 MB. They are the evidence behind every E4
# metric, so they are tracked rather than regenerated on demand, and they go
# through git-lfs. Everything else, including the ~44 MB E3 grids, stays as
# ordinary blobs -- LFS quota is the scarcer resource.
results/**/reference_snis_weighted_24d.npz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
results/**/reference_samples_24d.npz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
